      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Sure thing!\nHow to reproduce:\n1. Create a new project, import the SDK, add any realtime light (directional, point, spot) and a platform with the default Standard shader.\n2. Upload the world. Shadows will show under the player on PC, but not on Quest.\nWorlds this bug affects include Day Night Cycle Island and GesaRP (a world which I made and reuploaded with 2019).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
